OL,3,GNEWSASearch charity welcomes mobile    
OL,4,Asignal initiative                      
OL,6,FVolunteers have been exploring how a   
OL,7,Fmobile network's Smart SIM technology -
OL,8,Fwhich provides users with access to all
OL,9,Ffour major UK networks through one SIM 
OL,10,Fcard - could support operational search
OL,11,Fand rescue systems.                    
OL,13,FBSLAR said this has enabled key search 
OL,14,Fand rescue applications to operate more
OL,15,Feffectively.                           
